@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram - Alarm Clock

[*] --> OffState

state "Off" as OffState
state "Active" as ActiveState
state "Ringing" as RingingState

OffState --> ActiveState : set alarm time
ActiveState --> ActiveState : current time does not match [loop]
ActiveState --> RingingState : current time matches alarm time

RingingState --> ActiveState : turn off or stop ringing

ActiveState --> OffState : turn off before ringing
OffState --> [*] : power off

@enduml
